{"ID":"20240506102409-iiciolm","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506102409-iiciolm","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102409-iiciolm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620081946-vb4zonl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613112944-0gay2cr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1900,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620081946-phrz1td\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"306蚤休（重楼、七叶一枝花）","type":"doc","updated":"20240826100728"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240620081946-vb4zonl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620081946-vb4zonl","updated":"20240620081946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产云南、贵州、四川等地。\n【性状】\t根茎类圆柱形，多较平直，少数弯曲。直径16cm，长4.512cm。表面黄棕色，少数灰褐色，较平滑；环节较稀疏，突起不明显；茎痕半圆形或扁圆形，不规则排列，表面较平或稍突起。质坚硬，不易折断，断成粉质或角质化。气微，味苦。饮片切面白色或类白色，具粉性。\n【性味】\t苦，微寒，有小毒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，消肿止痛，凉肝定惊。作于疔肿痈肿、咽喉肿痛、毒蛇咬伤、跌扑伤痛、惊风抽搐。"}]},{"ID":"20240620081946-55nqj7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620081946-55nqj7v","updated":"20240620081946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206082404-pgiky7h.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620081946-c01rrdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620081946-c01rrdz","updated":"20240620081946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"重楼"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/重楼-20240205160339-r9kz8ks.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826095930-xpin00b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826095930-xpin00b","updated":"20240826100013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"重楼 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/重楼 1-20240826095930-fqzbgge.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 526px;","style":"width: 516px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"重楼 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/重楼 2-20240826100013-z681zfq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 516px;\" parent-style=\"width: 526px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826095835-qgptu5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826095835-qgptu5j","updated":"20240826100434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 354px;","style":"width: 344px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"重楼"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/重楼-20240826095835-1z14n7c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 344px;\" parent-style=\"width: 354px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 316px;","style":"width: 306px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"七叶一枝花3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/七叶一枝花3-20240701174254-c2pgtpf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"N